      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAWBOURNE OZZY (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 29.27 beating PEANUT KEEPING. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Looks the one to beat. BACK TOMORROW (2) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (29.52) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning 12 races. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expecting another good run. CONDO BANDIT (7) is on a hot streak of form, jumping from this box to score last time at this track (29.80), making it three straight wins. Has good speed and will be prominent from out wide. Expected to feature again. GALBA MODEL (8) scored in impressive time last start. Worth consideration.",
